    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16391" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eurus</span></b> , i, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖρος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the southeast wind</i> (pure Lat. Vulturnus),
				<i><span class="en">Col.
				11, 2, 65</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5,
				5, 15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 5, 16</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 2, 47,
				46, § 119</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Gell. 2,
				22, 7 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vitr. 1, 6</span></i>; Hor. C 
			 1, 28, 25; 2, 16, 24 al.—In
			plur., <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 2, 339</span></i>; <i><span class="en">441</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Ov.
				H. 11, 9 al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>The east wind</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. Tr. 1,
				2, 27</span></i> (opp. Zephyrus); <i><span class="en">id. M. 1,
			61</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Manil. 4, 589</span></i>.—
			Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b>Poet.</b>, <i>the east</i>, <i><span class="en">Val. Fl. 1,
				539</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Claud. Laud. Stil. 2,
			417</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Wind</i>, in gen., <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 3,
				382</span></i>.</div>
